<title>UK: GMAC prices $500 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>GMAC prices $500 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced</p>
<p>earlier in Asia, has been priced by joint lead manager HSBC</p>
<p>Markets and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL MOTORS ACCEPTANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT   $500 MLN	COUPON     6.75	 MATURITY  10.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE  EURO ASIAN    ISS PRICE  101.265    PAY DATE  10.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A3/A-    REOFFER    99.69	LAUNCH    25.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875    DENOMS     =	    SPREAD    +40 BP</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US (NOT 144A)/UK/HK	     LISTING   LON/HK</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30     SELL CONC  1.575	PAY FREQ    ANNUALLY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	CRS DEFLT  YES	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NY	 HOME CTRY  US</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5-YR W/I U.S. TREASURY BOND.</p>
<p>--London newsroom,  +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
